### Units — Homebase API
### Base URL: http://localhost:3000

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@propertyId = 0192f58e-4a61-7bf0-8e6f-47dc2e0f49f5
@unitId = 0192f58e-4a61-7bf0-8e6f-47dc2e0f49f6

### 1. Create a Unit
POST {{baseUrl}}/units
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitNumber": "A101",
  "blockName": "Block A",
  "propertyId": "{{propertyId}}"
}

### 2. Create another Unit (B202)
POST {{baseUrl}}/units
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitNumber": "B202",
  "blockName": "Block B",
  "propertyId": "{{propertyId}}"
}

### 3. Get All Units (with Pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/units?page=1&limit=10

### 4. Get Units Filtered by Property
GET {{baseUrl}}/units?propertyId={{propertyId}}

### 5. Get Units for a Property (Shortcut Route)
GET {{baseUrl}}/units/property/{{propertyId}}

### 6. Get Unit by ID (with details: property, tenancies, meters, tickets)
GET {{baseUrl}}/units/{{unitId}}

### 7. Update Unit
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/units/{{unitId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitNumber": "A101-Renovated",
  "blockName": "Block A East"
}

### 8. Delete Unit
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/units/{{unitId}}
